  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 亲临2026年ZOLLER开放日暨自动化峰会，体验精密与智能制造的新纪元 </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">诚邀您莅临位于密歇根州安娜堡的ZOLLER北美总部，参加我们一年一度的制造商、创新者和行业领袖盛会 — 本次活动旨在展示正在重塑现代刀具车间和制造流程的技术、战略及自动化解决方案。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/live/detail/1391\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">立即注册！</a></p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "top",
   "ftype": "text",
   "id": "c7417",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 庆祝ZOLLER成立80周年 — 安娜堡活动回顾 </h2>",
   "body": "<p>为期三天的活动邀请了客户、合作伙伴及行业领袖，深入了解我们的技术、团队，以及我们通过创新与精准塑造制造业未来的持续承诺。</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [
    {
     "kind": "iframe",
     "src": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4esLi8qbdp4?autohide=1&controls=1&enablejsapi=1&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.zoller.info",
     "title": "ZOLLER 80th Anniversary Open House – Ann Arbor, MI"
    }
   ],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c7415",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
